  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "甘味と　酸味が　強い　調味料。サンドウィッチに　使うには　甘みが強めなので　使うときは　注意しよう。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단맛과 신맛이 강한 조미료. 샌드위치에 사용하기엔 단맛이 강하므로 사용할 때는 주의하자.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甜味和酸味強勁的調味料。用於三明治時，甜味會偏重，所以使用時要多加留意。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût très sucré et acide. Attention à ne pas en tartiner de trop à l’intérieur d’un Sandwich, car cela risquerait de masquer les autres saveurs.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Verwendet man dieses sehr süß-saure Würzmittel bei der Zubereitung von Sandwiches, ist Vorsicht geboten, da die süße Note recht dominant sein kann.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Este ingrediente posee un fuerte sabor ácido, pero en los bocadillos suele destacar su dulzor, por lo que es mejor no usar demasiado para no empalagar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento molto dolce e aspro. È necessario usarlo con attenzione nei panini a causa della notevole dolcezza.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A condiment that’s very sweet and likewise very sour. Take care when adding it to sandwiches, as the sweet side can overwhelm.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甘味と　酸味が　強い　調味料。サンドウィッチに　使うには　甘みが強めなので　使うときは　注意しよう。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
